ACancelRacesTheSpendTest
├── when the spend runs before the pause
│   └── it should revert
├── when the pause comes before the spend
│   └── it should veto the spend, keep the attempt waiting and let anyone end it
├── when the spend is ordered before the veto in one block
│   └── it should refuse the spend and let the veto end the attempt
├── when the veto is ordered before the spend in one block
│   └── it should revert
├── when the setup ignores the pause
│   └── it should refuse the veto and run the spend through the pause
├── when the cancellation is ordered first
│   └── it should revert
└── when the spend is ordered first
    └── it should revert
